     1827            buf_price-doc-forming-gds.plt-id      = buf_price-doc-forming.plt-id       :
     1828       create ub.price-doc-forming-gds.
     1829       buffer-copy buf_price-doc-forming-gds to ub.price-doc-forming-gds
     1830       assign
     1831         ub.price-doc-forming-gds.plt-db-num  = p-plt-db-num
     1832         ub.price-doc-forming-gds.plt-id      = p-plt-id
     1833         ub.price-doc-forming-gds.pdf-db      = p-pdf-db-num
     1834         ub.price-doc-forming-gds.pdf-id      = p-pdf-id
     1835       .
